flowchart TD
    Event[Visitor Event] --> EventType{Event Type}

    EventType -->|Registration| RegNotify[Registration Notification]
    EventType -->|Approval| ApproveNotify[Approval Notification]
    EventType -->|Check-in| CheckinNotify[Check-in Notification]
    EventType -->|Check-out| CheckoutNotify[Check-out Notification]
    EventType -->|Rejection| RejectNotify[Rejection Notification]
    EventType -->|Overstay| OverstayNotify[Overstay Alert]

    RegNotify --> NotificationChannels{Notification Channels}
    ApproveNotify --> NotificationChannels
    CheckinNotify --> NotificationChannels
    CheckoutNotify --> NotificationChannels
    RejectNotify --> NotificationChannels
    OverstayNotify --> NotificationChannels

    NotificationChannels -->|Email| EmailChannel[Email Channel Service]
    NotificationChannels -->|SMS| SMSChannel[SMS Channel Service]
    NotificationChannels -->|WebSocket| WSChannel[WebSocket Channel]
    NotificationChannels -->|Database| DBChannel[Database Channel]

    EmailChannel --> EmailQueue[Queue Email Job]
    EmailQueue --> EmailProcess[Process Email SMTP]
    EmailProcess --> EmailDelivered{Delivered?}
    EmailDelivered -->|Yes| EmailSuccess[Email Success Log]
    EmailDelivered -->|No| EmailRetry[Retry Queue 3 attempts]
    EmailRetry --> EmailProcess

    SMSChannel --> SMSQueue[Queue SMS Job]
    SMSQueue --> SMSProcess[Process SMS Gateway]
    SMSProcess --> SMSDelivered{Delivered?}
    SMSDelivered -->|Yes| SMSSuccess[SMS Success Log]
    SMSDelivered -->|No| SMSRetry[Retry Queue 3 attempts]
    SMSRetry --> SMSProcess

    WSChannel --> RedisPub[Redis Pub/Sub Event]
    RedisPub --> ReverbServer[Reverb WebSocket Server]
    ReverbServer --> ConnectedClients[Connected Clients]
    ConnectedClients --> RealtimeUpdate[Real-time UI Update]

    DBChannel --> AuditLog[Audit Log Entry]
    AuditLog --> Compliance[Compliance Report]

    EmailSuccess --> NotificationComplete[Notification Complete]
    SMSSuccess --> NotificationComplete
    RealtimeUpdate --> NotificationComplete
    AuditLog --> NotificationComplete

    style Event fill:#e1f0ff
    style NotificationChannels fill:#fff4e1
    style RealtimeUpdate fill:#e1f5e1
    style EmailDelivered fill:#ffe1e1
    style SMSDelivered fill:#ffe1e1
